'''Gingerbread '''is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 9th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The whole knife is made out of gingerbread, hence the name. The spine of the blade and the handle are covered in a thick coat of white frosting. Scattered along the knife are green and red pieces of candy.

==Trivia==  
*It has a [[Gingerbread Gun (2019)|partner gun]] under the same name.
